OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FOfficers chase car thieves through
OL,7,     Fthe Essex suburbs, break up a
OL,8,     Fnightclub fight and tackle some
OL,9,     Fboy racers in sunny Southend.
OL,10,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FThe interceptors chase a stolen
OL,12,     F4x4, give a couple of car thieves
OL,13,     Fan early wake-up call and tackle a
OL,14,     Froad-tax evader.
OL,15,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,16,     FStanway Police are first on the
OL,17,     Fscene of a bad car crash on a
OL,18,     Fcountry road. Four cop cars pursue
OL,19,     Fa speeding jeep down the M25.
