OL,7,     Ffor a rash on her hands, Ryan has
OL,8,     Fa painful lump in his throat, and
OL,9,     FBenjamin talks to Dr Chris Harris
OL,10,     Fabout his anxiety and depression.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FParamedics speed in 71-year-old
OL,13,     FEnid, who's struggling to breathe.
OL,14,     FIn Paediatrics, three-year-old
OL,15,     FRory is rushed in with a rare
OL,16,     Fcondition: a conker stuck up his
OL,17,     Fnose.
